le Drainage Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"spec-preview\" id=\"preview\">\n<video autoplay=\"\" controls=\"\" id=\"media\" style=\"display:none\">\n<source src=\"#\"/>\n</video>\n<span class=\"jqzoom\" id=\"ooooo\"><img alt=\"Electric Submersible Pump\" jqimg=\"/uploads/201816806/electric-submersible-pump03330558400.jpg\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/electric-submersible-pump03330558400.jpg\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"spec-scroll\"><a class=\"prev\"></a><a class=\"next\"></a>\n<div class=\"items\">\n<ul><li><span><img alt=\"\" bimg=\"/uploads/201816806/electric-submersible-pump03330558400.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/electric-submersible-pump03330558400.jpg\"/></span></li><li><span><img alt=\"\" bimg=\"/uploads/201816806/electric-submersible-pump08383675885.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/electric-submersible-pump08383675885.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Electric Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We supply electric submersible pump. JIADI is a professional manufacturer and exporter of water pumps, own the import and export authority. We have the professional team for design, produce and sales. Have all kinds of goods, passed ISO9001 and CE certificates....</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52046205\"/></p><p><strong>electric submersible pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231604475987612.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply electric submersible pump. JIADI is a professional manufacturer and exporter of water pumps, own the import  and export authority. We have the professional team for design, produce and sales.  Have all kinds of goods, passed ISO9001 and CE certificates.</p><p><strong>Categories:</strong> submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow</strong> (m3/h): 5 / 15.7</p><p><strong>Head</strong> (m): 4 / 186</p><p><strong>Power</strong> (kW): 0.75 / 7.5</p><p><strong>Performance Curve:</strong></p><p><strong>Construction:</strong><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231606038372412.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231604461286489.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 2. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p><strong>Performance:</strong></p><p>Capacity up to 15.7 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 186 m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 7.5 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>Applications:</strong></p><p>Water supply, civil and industrial applications, garden use and irrigation.</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231606597442834.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>Operating conditions:</strong></p><p>Water temperature up to 35 °C.</p><p>Max. sand quantity into the water: 150 g/m3.</p><p>Continuous duty. </p><p><strong>Packing and Shipping: </strong></p><p>Export standard carton with Plastic bag or Foam.</p><p>Delivery Time &amp; Port:20-30days/Ningbo port or Shanghai port or Lianyungang port</p><p><strong>FAQ:</strong></p><p><strong>Q1: How long is the warranty of our company’s products?</strong></p><p>A: 1 year usually.</p><p><strong>Q2: Are you a factory or a trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacturer that specializes in water pumps for more than 30 years.</p><p><strong>Q3: How can I place order? </strong></p><p>A: You can contact us by email about your order details.</p><p><strong>Q4: How can I pay you? </strong></p><p>A: After you confirm our PI, we will request you to pay. T/T and Paypal, Western Union are the most usual ways we are using. </p><p><strong>Q5: How do you take care when your clients received defective products? </strong></p><p>A: replacement. If there are some defective items, we usually credit to our customer or replace in next shipment. </p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: electric submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-submersible-pump/2-inch-submersible-impeller-pump\"><img alt=\"2 Inch Submersible Impeller Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-inch-submersible-impeller-pump35060563090a77d.j